{"rpid": "766229441", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "江南烟雨云遮月", "mid": "44588566", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "It's only the fairy tale\n《不过只是童话》\n作词：JIM STEELE\n作曲/编曲：梶浦由记\n歌：宫村优子\n那些正在痛苦的小女孩是谁？\n她们被捕获到月亮背面的黑暗城堡\n这十二个小女孩徒然地放出光彩\n像数年才绽放一次的花朵般\n她们在阴影下如同那爱的低语般舞动着\n在梦中的他们才像鸽子般自由\n在被诅咒的牢笼中他们永远不被允许去爱\n他们相信这只是传说\n---------------------------------\nWho are those little girls in pain\njust trapped in castle of dark side of moon?\nTwelve of them shining bright in vain\nlike flowers that blossom just once in years.\nThey’re dancing in the shadow like whispers of love\njust dreaming of place where they’re free as drove.\nThey’ve never been allowed to love in this cursed cage.\nIt’s only the fairy tale they believe.", "like": 16, "ctime": 1525458013, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "361995", "video_bvid": "BV1vx411F7ow", "video_title": "[英法德西4语翻唱]It's only the fairy tale", "video_desc": "搬运自y2b", "video_owner": "Parsee Mizuhashi", "video_view": 12900, "video_reply": 42, "video_n1": 25, "video_n2": 17}
